dialogue joined_street
title: Under the same ruins
trigger: Joined street
speaker commander $commander
speaker hero $hero

node open commander
  The new one from the Underspire sits on the wagon's tailboard, watching the camp the way a runner watches a street: every exit counted.
  * You walked beside us a long way before you said yes. -> walked
    if: TrustAtLeast $hero 15
  * You're with the caravan now. I wanted to hear it from you, not the roster. -> signed

node walked hero
  I wanted to see if you'd sell me out first. Everybody up top does, sooner or later. You had three chances and didn't take one.
  -> ruins

node signed hero
  The roster's right. Food, a wagon, and somebody pointing the swords the same way. That's a better deal than the Underspire ever gave me.
  -> ruins

node ruins hero
  Where I grew up, we lived under Halcyon's dead towers and stole light off its old taps. Then you show up and the dead tech starts humming. Who are you?
  -> who

node who commander
  The orb at the Commander's belt glows a little brighter, as it always does near Halcyon metal.
  * I was a commander of Halcyon. I died in the Still, and it brought me back. -> truth
    do: AddTrust $hero 5
  * Someone the old machines remember. I don't remember much else. -> pieces
    do: AddTrust $hero 3
  * Someone who pays you to fight. That's enough to know. -> boss
    do: AddTrust $hero -5

node truth hero
  Died. In the Still. And walked out. Everyone in the Underspire has a story about that vault, and none of them end with somebody walking out.
  -> tithe

node pieces hero
  Straight answer. I'll take a straight answer over a pretty one. Half the gangs down there lie about where they come from.
  -> tithe

node boss hero
  Fine. Bosses I understand. Redline had bosses. They all said that right before they asked for something worse.
  -> tithe

node tithe hero
  We dodged the Choir's collectors our whole lives. Ran the roofs when the white wagons came. Now I'm riding toward them on purpose.
  -> ask

node ask commander
  The runner turns a stolen coin over and over between two fingers.
  * Then teach the rest of us how to dodge them. We'll need it. -> teach
    do: AddTrust $hero 8
  * You don't have to run anymore. Not while you're with us. -> safe
    do: AddTrust $hero 4
  * Keep your eyes open. If this goes bad, I need to know first. -> watch
    do: AddTrust $hero 6

node teach hero
  Ha. Nobody up top ever asked a Street kid to teach them anything. First lesson: never stand where the light's good.

node safe hero
  Everybody runs, Commander. But I'll run in your direction for a while, and we'll see.

node watch hero
  Eyes are the one thing the Street gave me for free. You'll hear it from me before anyone else does.
